\loch\af2\dbch\af2\hich\f2\strike0\ulnone\cf2 All members in this chamber had an opportunity last December to decide whether they were in favour of higher energy prices or lower energy prices. We, on this side, were in favour of lower energy prices, those opposite voted for higher energy prices.}
